Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.80,0:22:47.30,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}落叶织就的床沿
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.93,0:22:54.14,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}你为何偏偏要离开我身边？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.69,0:22:59.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}沙粒一点一点
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.40,0:23:03.61,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}溜出我的指间
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.61,0:23:06.57,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}我努力去分辨
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.78,0:23:10.37,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像未解的谜团
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.37,0:23:11.91,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像我坠入的海渊
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.91,0:23:13.45,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像旧靴的鞋面
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.45,0:23:15.00,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像命运牵起的线
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.00,0:23:16.58,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}带我来到你身边
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.58,0:23:18.17,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像浆果汁一般
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.17,0:23:19.75,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}是我心底的怅然
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.63,0:23:24.76,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}如今你究竟去了哪边
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.76,0:23:27.93,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}明明曾与你心意相连
